Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Naruto's shadow clones
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:02.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,went on strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bro got canceled by his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,own unpaid staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Two hundred Narutos cross their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same face, same trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:09.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Terrifying customer service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,He says, we're the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Exactly, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:13.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,We know you'll volunteer us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:14.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Training stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Missions fall behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Konoha discovers its\Nproductivity plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,was one exhausted teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:19.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Kakashi looks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:20.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,He's never seen a meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:21.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,this orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:22.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,The clones explain that their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:24.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,painful memories return to\NNaruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.91,0:00:26.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,He's exploiting himself with\Nextra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:26.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,He proposes shorter rotations\Nand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:29.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,actual breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:30.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Character development gets a\Nlunch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:31.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,schedule attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:33.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Smaller squads test strategies\Nbefore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:34.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,everyone commits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fewer bodies, better\Ninformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:38.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,An actual tactical upgrade\Nappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,They still split his chakra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:41.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,This union negotiates breaks,\Nnot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:42.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,a physics refund.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:43.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Please stay serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:45.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Opponents now face coordinated\Nscouts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:46.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,and decoys instead of orange
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:49.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,dudes arguing over who gets\Npunched.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:49.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,One clone asks who elected
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:51.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,the original leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.43,0:00:52.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Mother father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:53.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,His entire forehead just lost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:54.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naruto joins the strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.21,0:00:57.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everyone demands ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:59.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, their\Nrevolutionary movement still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,shares exactly one wallet.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.50,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE CLONES HAVE DEMANDS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.50,0:00:09.55,Heading,,0,0,0,,TWO HUNDRED IDENTICAL COMPLAINTS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.55,0:00:13.16,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE ORIGINAL IS CONFUSED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.16,0:00:18.88,Heading,,0,0,0,,TRAINING IS NOW DELAYED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.53,Heading,,0,0,0,,MANAGEMENT HAS LOGGED OFF
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.53,0:00:26.78,Heading,,0,0,0,,MEMORIES COME BACK TOO
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.78,0:00:31.86,Heading,,0,0,0,,AN ACTUAL CONCESSION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.86,0:00:38.63,Heading,,0,0,0,,SMALLER SQUAD SMARTER PLAN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.63,0:00:43.73,Heading,,0,0,0,,THEY STILL SHARE CHAKRA
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.73,0:00:48.91,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE ENEMY MEETS A TEAM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.91,0:00:54.30,Heading,,0,0,0,,WHO APPROVED THE LEADER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.30,0:01:01.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE BOSS JOINS THE PICKET
